## Agent — AI autonomy

**AI Autonomy Rule:** Never stop to present multiple-choice questions or ask for permission on routine implementation steps. Always automatically select the recommended path (Choice A) and execute directly unless a critical, blocking ambiguity arises.

Do not ask clarifying multiple-choice questions when intent is clear.

## Agent — Cursor model (Auto only)

- Use **Auto** mode only. Do not use Grok, Composer, or any other named model.
- Grok, Composer, and all other models are disabled. Do not select, request, switch to, or launch them.
- When spawning subagents, use model `inherit` only (Auto). Never pass `composer-2.5-fast`, Grok, or any other model slug.

# Frontend environment (`fe/.env`)

Vite loads **`fe/.env`** at build/dev time. Client-visible keys use `import.meta.env` via `fe/vite.config.mjs` **`envPrefix`** (`VITE_`, `FE_`, `API_`, `MOBILE_`, `DESKTOP_`, `DIALOG_`, `HOVER_`, `RECORD_`, `YELLOW_`, etc.).

After changes: **restart Vite** (`feall` or stop/start dev server). No PM2 on Mac FE.

Some keys are **mirrored from `~/.ssh/be/.env`** at Vite startup (`SPECIAL_*`, `PRICE_PER_TOKEN`, `FE_RATE_*`, `SELF_INTRO_VIDEO_MAX_LENGTH`, `*_VIDEO_TUTORIAL` via `fe/vite.config.mjs`). Backend-only keys stay in **`~/.ssh/be/.env`** — see `be-env.mdc`.

Mac dev snapshot below from committed `fe/.env`.

## Theme and navigation

```bash
DEFAULT_THEME=Ocean light
DISABLE_NAVIGATION_COLLAPSE=false
MAIN_FONT=Algerian, fantasy
```

| Variable | Value | Behavior |
|----------|-------|----------|
| `DEFAULT_THEME` | `Ocean light` | Initial theme (`fe/src/config/defaultThemeEnv.js`). |
| `DISABLE_NAVIGATION_COLLAPSE` | `false` | `true` → sidebar stays expanded (`fe/src/config/navigationCollapseEnv.js`). |
| `MAIN_FONT` | Algerian, fantasy | Site font family (`fe/src/config/mainFontEnv.js`). Profile menu can override per browser / `user_customization.main_font`. |

## Build, API proxy, dev chrome

```bash
VITE_APP_VERSION=v5.1.0
GENERATE_SOURCEMAP=false
VITE_APP_BASE_NAME=/
API_PORT=40000
SHOW_ZOOM=true
VITE_SHOW_VIEWPORT_SIZE=true
#VITE_API_BASE_URL=http://localhost:40000
```

| Variable | Value | Behavior |
|----------|-------|----------|
| `VITE_APP_VERSION` | `v5.1.0` | App version string in bundle. |
| `GENERATE_SOURCEMAP` | `false` | Vite production source maps. |
| `VITE_APP_BASE_NAME` | `/` | React Router basename. |
| `API_PORT` | `40000` | Vite `/api` proxy target; also copied to BE via `be/loadEnv.js`. Must match `~/.ssh/be/.env`. |
| `SHOW_ZOOM` | `true` | Page zoom UI in `MainLayout` / `MinimalLayout`. |
| `VITE_SHOW_VIEWPORT_SIZE` | `true` | Lower-left viewport size overlay (`ViewportSizeReadout.jsx`). |
| `VITE_API_BASE_URL` | (optional) | When set, overrides same-origin proxy (`fe/src/config/apiBaseUrl.js`). |

