## Keys in `~/.ssh/be/.env` used by FE (not in `fe/.env`)

Set on the backend env file; some are injected into the Vite bundle or exposed via `/api` config:

| Variable | FE usage |
|----------|----------|
| `SPECIAL_LINK` / `SPECIAL_ID` / `SPECIAL_P` | Dev login prefill (`specialLoginEnv.js`). |
| `PRICE_PER_TOKEN` | Token pricing display (`pricePerTokenEnv.js`). |
| `FE_RATE_*` | Browser API rate limit (`clientApiRateLimitEnv.js`). |
| `SELF_INTRO_VIDEO_MAX_LENGTH` | Self intro recorder max seconds (`selfIntroVideoMaxLengthEnv.js`). |
| `SPEEDDATING` | `true` → show Speed Dating in the sidebar (`speedDatingEnv.js`). Else hide. |
| `ALL_SINGLES_VIDEO_TUTORIAL` / `PICKS_POSTS_VIDEO_TUTORIAL` / `ACQUAINTS_BUDDIES_VIDEO_TUTORIAL` / `MYALBUM_VIDEO_TUTORIAL` / `MYSELFREPORTBIO_VIDEO_TUTORIAL` / `RECEIVED_BIO_REQUEST_VIDEO_TUTORIAL` / `PROFILE_RECORDS_VIDEO_TUTORIAL` / `TOPRIGHT_VIDEO_TUTORIAL` | Per-menu **VIDEO TUTORIALS** header button (`pageVideoTutorialEnv.js`). |
| `SCAN_FOR_PHONE_UPLOAD_SEC` | Also set in **`fe/.env`** when tuning desktop QR poll — `phoneUploadScanEnv.js`. |
| `DIALOG_ZOOM`, `DIALOG_*_OFFSET` | Auth dialog tuning — prefer **`fe/.env`** `DIALOG_*` for width/margins. |
| Rekognition / IDV | `SKIP_DL_PASSPORT_CHECK`, `SKIP_LIVE_FACE_SCAN`, etc. — BE only (`be-env.mdc`). |

## When changing these

1. Edit **`fe/.env`** (and **`~/.ssh/be/.env`** when `API_PORT`, `FE_RATE_*`, or other mirrored keys must stay aligned).
2. Restart **Vite** on Mac (required after **`FE_RATE_*`** or other mirrored key changes).
3. Restart **PM2** (`pm2 restart onlinemallwebsite`) when backend-only **`~/.ssh/be/.env`** keys change; re-run FE build/deploy when mirrored keys change on prod.
